# tally 2.1.8 R14 (#175), L §5.10, E §6.1: at a place of unit any a pad's id ends with its unit, so two units' pads
# at one instant are two movements (count 2), and explain lists EUR's pad only.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit USD: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pad broker from world
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 3.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask n: count(p in pads over 2026-02)
ask e: explain bal(broker, EUR, 2026-02-20)
=== expect
e: 4.00 EUR
  balance of broker (EUR) at the end of 2026-02-20
  from: pad v1:stated[broker] 2026-02-15 end = 4.00 EUR, 2026-02-15 end (version v1, source s, locator "s"), gap role pad from world, gap 3.00 EUR (pads:v1:broker@2026-02-15 end:EUR)
  no movement
  pad: broker 2026-02-15 end, pads:v1:broker@2026-02-15 end:EUR of 3.00 EUR
  cut 2026-06-10
n: 2
  cut 2026-06-10
